        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat clicker game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and refreshing cat punching game that both adults and children can enjoy is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is tap, so even beginners can play with confidence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(But if you're not careful, you might get tossed around by the mice!?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cat and hone your punching skills! Aim to be the strongest professional cat puncher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun playing in three modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Mouse Whacking Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the mice that appear one after another! Become a cat and defeat the mice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Peanut Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the peanuts that the mice throw at you in good tempo to destroy them! You'll get addicted to the speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Prank Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relieve stress by smashing things in your room! Challenge yourself to see how many you can destroy within the time limit!</p>",
